#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Exact certificate: none of the 49 6x6 row/column deletions of the
Kressner--Vandereycken order-7 integer witness is a counterexample.

For each 6x6 matrix A_{r,c} formed by deleting one row r and one column c,
we certify
    ||L_A|_K||^2 < tau < R_S(v) <= ||L_A|_S||^2
with an integer tau, an integer symmetric-coordinate vector v, and an exact
LDL^T positivity check over fractions.

Natural integer bases:
 S: E_ii, E_ij+E_ji with Gram diag(1,...,1,2,...,2)
 K: E_ij-E_ji with Gram 2 I.
"""
